# Gateway local: 5000, Docker: 6000. Copy tripId from create and driverId from Matching.
@host = http://localhost:5000
@tripId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@driverId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@gatewayToken = mock-retry-success

### Create trip and view OSRM-based quote
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "riderId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "pickupAddress": "227 Nguyen Van Cu, HCMC",
  "dropoffAddress": "Ben Thanh Market, HCMC",
  "pickupLat": 10.762622,
  "pickupLng": 106.682373,
  "dropoffLat": 10.772545,
  "dropoffLng": 106.698032,
  "hasToll": false,
  "isRaining": false
}

### Explicitly invite a driver; copy driverId from the response
POST {{host}}/api/v1/matching/match
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tripId": "{{tripId}}" }

### Wait until offeredDriverId equals driverId before accepting/rejecting; events are asynchronous
### Inspect current offer and payment outcome
GET {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}

### Accept the current offer
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/driver-accept
Content-Type: application/json

{ "driverId": "{{driverId}}" }

### Reject instead of accept; call Matching manually again if count <= k
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/driver-reject
Content-Type: application/json

{ "driverId": "{{driverId}}" }

### Pick up
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/pickup

### Drop off and pay using a fresh picked-up trip for each scenario
# mock-retry-success: transient error on the initial attempt and first retry, then success on the second retry
# mock-retry-exhausted: transient error on every attempt, trip stays PaymentPending
# mock-decline: confirmed rejection, publishes PaymentFailedEvent
# mock-success: immediate success
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/dropoff
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentMethod": "Card", "gatewayToken": "{{gatewayToken}}" }

### Cancel before pickup
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/cancel
